      <activity id="87a2bb72-637a-5b7e-975c-b39a3a852ab2" activityNameId="c71ac974-4dd4-5b21-878e-e5a9934b19d7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, inner door, natural, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, inner door, natural, at plant
The measures of the visible door leaf are 0.9m x 2m. The door and corresponding frame are painted. The bill of materials is based on data from door manufactures.;
UUID: 34c21493-7cb6-3ac9-90c2-63f4d1a65f4a
Included are the materials used for the surface treatment (natural) of the inner door leaf and the door frame. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 door manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_34c21493-7cb6-3ac9-90c2-63f4d1a65f4a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
